# docs/queue.md is merged by row id, not by line (docs/decisions.md §263).
#
# git ignores a driver named here that its config does not define, and falls
# back to the line merge without a word, so `just check-queue-merge-driver`
# fails when this clone has not registered it, and names the command:
# `mise exec -- just queue-merge-driver`.
docs/queue.md merge=queue-rows
